Wed Oct 28 16:34:14 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- The shipped binary talks to org.freedesktop.portal.* (file chooser,
  screen share), but no portal frontend was declared, so those
  features fail with "No such interface" on a minimal install.
  Add weak Recommends on xdg-desktop-portal and
  xdg-desktop-portal-gtk - never a hard dependency on a desktop
  stack.

Tue Oct 27 17:25:49 UTC 2026 - Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>

- rpmlintrc: filter the immutable upstream payload findings (RUNPATH
  $ORIGIN x2, statically-linked bundled git-lfs/rg, duplicated files,
  locale .mo, hicolor-icon-theme) and drop the unused
  invalid-desktopfile filter - TW rpmlint aborted at Badness 20104
  over the 999 threshold on 2026-10-27
- update.sh: rebuild the Debtransform wrapper tarball on the
  "already up to date" path too - a fresh checkout carries no gitignored
  artifacts, so sync_files deleted the only OBS copy and all 3 targets
  failed in debtransform (run 40539185674)

